s of which=20
     <quote>nu</quote>selbri may correctly be predicated) are only moderate=
ly=20
     <quote>abstract</quote>. They are still closely tied to happenings in =
space and time. Properties, however, are much more ethereal. What is=20
     <quote>the property of being blue</quote>, or=20
     <quote>the property of being a go-er</quote>? They are what logicians =
call=20
     <quote>intensions</quote>. If John has a heart, then=20
     <quote>the property of having a heart</quote>is an abstract object whi=
ch, when applied to John, is true. In fact,</para>
