     li mo'e re ratcu su'i mo'e re ractu du li mo'e vo danlu
     The-number two rats plus two rabbits equals the-number four animals.
     2 rats + 2 rabbits =3D 4 animals.
 </programlisting>
     <bridgehead>
-    <anchor xml:id=3D"MOhI" />selma'o MOhI (
+    <anchor xml:id=3D"MOhI" />selma'o MOhI (=20
     <xref linkend=3D"cll_chapter10-section8" />)</bridgehead>
     <para>A tense flag indicating movement in space, in a direction specif=
ied by a following=20
     <xref linkend=3D"FAhA" />cmavo.</para>
     <programlisting xml:space=3D"preserve">
     le verba mo'i ri'u cadzu le bisli
     The child [movement] [right] walks-on the ice.
     The child walks toward my right on the ice.
 </programlisting>
     <bridgehead>
-    <anchor xml:id=3D"NA" />selma'o NA (
+    <anchor xml:id=3D"NA" />selma'o NA (=20
     <xref linkend=3D"cll_chapter14-section3" />,=20
     <xref linkend=3D"cll_chapter15-section7" />)</bridgehead>
